---
// How a shop's PCs and phones fit together: the main PC holds everything; the rest reach it over the shop's own
// network; the internet is optional (the Suite's install and updates guides).
---
<figure class="net" aria-labelledby="net-cap">
  <div class="cloud box">
    <h3>The internet</h3>
    <p>Optional. Only for updates and the cloud backup, when they run.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="link dashed" aria-hidden="true"></div>

  <div class="main box">
    <h3>The main PC</h3>
    <p>Runs Karots Suite and keeps all your data. Backs itself up every 6 hours, with a copy on a USB stick.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="link" aria-hidden="true"><span>Your shop’s wired network or wifi</span></div>

  <div class="row">
    <div class="box">
      <h3>Cashier PCs</h3>
      <p>Show the till in a browser. Nothing to install, no licence of their own.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="box">
      <h3>Phones</h3>
      <p>The owner’s admin pages and reports, and Karots Shelf while your staff set the shop up.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="box">
      <h3>Printers and scanners</h3>
      <p>Plug into the main PC or a cashier PC, by USB.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <figcaption id="net-cap">Everything talks to the main PC inside the shop, so the shop keeps selling with no internet at all. <b>With more than one device (a cashier PC, a phone, Karots Shelf), the shop needs a wifi router or a wired network</b>; one PC on its own needs none.</figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .net { margin: 0; display: grid; justify-items: center; max-width: 60rem }
  .box { padding: 1rem 1.2rem; border-radius: var(--r-tile); background-color: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--line); width: 100%; max-width: 26rem }
  .box h3 { margin: 0 0 0.3rem; font-size: 1.15rem }
  .box p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted) }
  .main { border: 3px solid var(--saffron) }
  .cloud { border-style: dashed; background-color: transparent }
  .link { position: relative; width: 3px; height: 2.75rem; background-color: var(--line) }
  .link.dashed { background: none; border-left: 3px dashed var(--line); width: 0 }
  .link span { position: absolute; left: 0.75rem; top: 50%; transform: translateY(-50%); width: 9.5rem; font-size: 0.85rem; line-height: 1.3; color: var(--muted) }
  @media (min-width: 760px) { .link span { width: auto; white-space: nowrap; left: 1rem; font-size: 0.9rem } }
  .row { display: grid; gap: 0.75rem; width: 100% }
  .row .box { max-width: none }
  figcaption { margin-top: 1.5rem; max-width: 40rem; text-align: center }
  @media (min-width: 760px) {
    .row { grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); padding-top: 1rem; border-top: 3px solid var(--line) }
  }
</style>
